notes.content:
A major update for "Mutated Muter's Invasion" to enhance gameplay experience is out! Some key points are:


The screen/window dimensions and the in-game pixel-wise render zone are re-factored to match 1920x1080 instead of 1696x960, as this gives a better view field for this game's sprite/object sizes;
NEW CONTENT: Better graphics and animations for some objects (particularly some enemies) and updated soundtrack;
fixes and improvements to the user interface;
Enhancements to the clarity of textual information, especially in the tutorial


And, of course, miscellaneous fixes and improvements. Enhance your un-Muting experience with this key update!
